<section class="content-section">
    <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-text">
            <h2>Our Story</h2>

            <p>
                Founded in 2026, <strong>Savor</strong> was created with one simple dream:
                to serve delicious, high-quality vegetarian food that brings happiness to every table.
                What started as a small family kitchen has now become a favorite place for food lovers
                who enjoy fresh ingredients, rich flavors, and beautiful presentation.
            </p>

            <p>
                At Savor, we believe that food is not only about taste, but also about experience.
                Every dish is prepared with love, care, and attention to detail. From crispy snacks
                to cheesy pizzas, flavorful Punjabi dishes, sizzling platters, and fusion meals,
                our menu is designed to satisfy every craving.
            </p>

            <p>
                We carefully choose our ingredients from trusted local suppliers and farmers.
                Our aim is to provide food that is fresh, hygienic, sustainable, and full of authentic flavor.
                Whether you are dining with family, hanging out with friends, or ordering your favorite meal,
                Savor is always ready to serve you the best.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-image">
            <img 
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546069901-ba9599a7e63c?ixlib=rb-1.2.1&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" 
